WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.475
Variables start over each time the page opens; localStorage keeps what you saved

2
00:00:06.452 --> 00:00:10.552
The page reads a saved number, adds one, and saves it again.

3
00:00:13.643 --> 00:00:17.218
The first visit: nothing was saved, so it starts at 1.

4
00:00:22.216 --> 00:00:27.466
Each run is a new visit. The variable starts over; the saved number does not.
